{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/73386bdab820ef20d60d39315582afe275895342.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> inches, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68227ec2efd9339ffd16251b000f7b70017e121.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> inches, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9091ac9c1cd5f84e3de2842a134d2921d49ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> inches. The radius of the inscribed circle is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/91862559f3b6b51c8538675f8f06f01155676c88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 26\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 13\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\text{ in} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"534\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The inradius is equal to the area divided by semiperimeter. The area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b4400122497c6aa81009064021afca5d065812.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(10)(24)}{2} = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" /> because it's a right triangle, as it's side length satisfies the Pythagorean Theorem. The semiperimeter is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore the inradius is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f03028c2292cd337ee145bd8db85ebe2afe59d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since this is a right triangle, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53e2d600b5c1b592b671476025d743990210a2c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+b-c}{2}=\\boxed{4}\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>- kante314\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that the formula of in radius is area of triangle by its semiperimeter , hence it is a right triangle =&gt; area is 1/2×24×10=120 and semiperimeter is 60/2=30 =&gt; 120/30=4\nHK🗿\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"